msgid ""
"Your RIM personal subscription will be used for unattended sessions, while "
"your current incident pass can be used for keyword-based sessions on one "
"target machine over the next %{time_span}. The following applies to keyword-"
"based sessions on additional target machines, and to any keyword-based "
"sessions after your current incident pass has expired."
